  "details": "Animation parameter that can be able to programmed and played when user leave instance. That can be useful to create a custom leave animation/particles than just \"frozen and gone\" from instance.\n\nIf this idea is an \"abuse concern\" The best practices is just limited to max 5 second after user leave decided to the world/game, It can be disabled by safety settings, same category as avatar animation.\n\nAlso, lately I've been spotted some update that when a user leaves the world, their POV will fade to black and disconnect, rather than disconnect immediately. This gives an idea that it's doable when there's already 2-3 second of fade to black animation for user POV cam.",
